{"about_the_game":"<strong><i>KIN is a colourful indie platformer, that will awe you with its beautiful otherworldly landscapes and surprise you with its challenging boss fights.</i></strong> <br><br>Lively colours, intuitive gameplay and interesting level design set the tone for KIN, in which the player moves through the world as a mysterious, tiny girl with a full head of hair clad in a bright dress. Defeating enemies and solving puzzles, she leaps from platform to platform, travelling through different landscapes.<br><br>The game holds an abstract aesthetic that has become characteristic for House of Secrets, the studio behind KIN, through their earlier VR experiences such as APEX and Surge.<br><br><i>KIN supports both the original VR mode from when it was first launched, as well a new camera mode and input system that allows the game to be played as a traditional non VR platformer.</i>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"1c5755775714a2b04e6baef25919d3faf11e5374.jpg","localized_name":"Storming the beach","name":"Storming the beach","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/879200/1c5755775714a2b04e6baef25919d3faf11e5374.jpg"},{"icon":"b276bdb58d8616ba1b170335354dace4d4411e5e.jpg","localized_name":"Jungle fever","name":"Jungle fever","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/879200/b276bdb58d8616ba1b170335354dace4d4411e5e.jpg"},{"icon":"17c44a7a1276669b3d51d35ecd1cb6879dd2fb0e.jpg","localized_name":"This is bat country","name":"This is bat country","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/879200/17c44a7a1276669b3d51d35ecd1cb6879dd2fb0e.jpg"},{"icon":"1cdcc1c9f802164b8a3b193b576efac5de5440b5.jpg","localized_name":"Wasteland wanderer","name":"Wasteland wanderer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/879200/1cdcc1c9f802164b8a3b193b576efac5de5440b5.jpg"},{"icon":"984f35885df83f52a963bfe624827e56b782e87d.jpg","localized_n